{"steam_appid":4001890,"steam_name":"How to Fish","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4001890/1509866700/0a2d65236b13d187ce8d7d8eca946a501b7fad47/1786614175/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1786615113","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257398070/c47e43c832e4ef437aa8368eb0d0d886251ef8d4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1786615113","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/48f6817fe466a7c9666605527558bf1fac48d0d2/ss_48f6817fe466a7c9666605527558bf1fac48d0d2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787234618","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/5f867d8c9b03c63867cc95b7bfaa4a3d2193ea48/ss_5f867d8c9b03c63867cc95b7bfaa4a3d2193ea48.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787234618","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/2a912cdbf746286400cece1ca607ac077c11a1dc/ss_2a912cdbf746286400cece1ca607ac077c11a1dc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787234618","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/e15ab15c09cd3f6ec06d4ffacdf07f6c2b679db2/ss_e15ab15c09cd3f6ec06d4ffacdf07f6c2b679db2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787234618","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/65be87272efaa4bac87e16dc764a9535165effd2/ss_65be87272efaa4bac87e16dc764a9535165effd2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787234618"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 1-4 player physics based fishing simulator. While drinking and boating you suddenly crash into a small island. To work your way back home you have to learn How to Fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here is a gif:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/1dc37b826a1676f74cfd58f7b2be628d.poster.avif?t=1787234618\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/1dc37b826a1676f74cfd58f7b2be628d.webm?t=1787234618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/1dc37b826a1676f74cfd58f7b2be628d.mp4?t=1787234618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you do in the game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish fish, kill fish, sell fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start off with no gear or weapons,  earn money to buy better gear and weapons and stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests and fight bosses to progress to new islands, where there are more dangerous creatures and better gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to collect the rare variant of all the different fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit trick shots for more money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble for even more money</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Another one:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/98015355a5ef6350739ed3f162c6c05b.poster.avif?t=1787234618\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/98015355a5ef6350739ed3f162c6c05b.webm?t=1787234618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/98015355a5ef6350739ed3f162c6c05b.mp4?t=1787234618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three why not:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/98cebda8eff48210e76e7a98e07309e6.poster.avif?t=1787234618\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/98cebda8eff48210e76e7a98e07309e6.webm?t=1787234618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/98cebda8eff48210e76e7a98e07309e6.mp4?t=1787234618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ok four:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/acb06d9d7cf9402ecad1e1f43986108a.poster.avif?t=1787234618\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/acb06d9d7cf9402ecad1e1f43986108a.webm?t=1787234618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/acb06d9d7cf9402ecad1e1f43986108a.mp4?t=1787234618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-5257U, AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050, AMD RX 460 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Dazed Games"],"publishers":["Dazed Games"],"release_date":"20 Aug, 2026"}